@local/subagent-switch README · dsh-subagent-switch：> Subagents in DSH normally inherit whatever model the parent session is on. If you have 100+ models across several providers, that means your research subagent is burning `x1.62` tokens to answer a one-line question — or your coding subagent is running on the free model that's explicitly bad at code. This plugin intercepts the spawn and picks per task instead.

如果你觉得它有用，**给个 Star** ⭐ —— 这类小工具没什么曝光，一颗星就是最直接的反馈，也让后面需要它的人更容易搜到。

---

@local/subagent-switch README · 官方 profile 一般在 ~/.dsh/profiles/desktop：```

编辑 `<profile>/package.json`：

```jsonc
{
  "dependencies": {
    "@local/subagent-switch": "link:<插件目录>"
  },
  "dsh": {
    "profile": {
      "bundles": [
        "@local/subagent-switch"   // 加这一行
      ]
    }
  }
}
```

@local/subagent-switch README · 3. 重启 DSH：bundle 只在启动时加载。重启后左侧栏会多一个「子代理模型切换」入口。

> **改了插件代码也要重启。** 宿主半（`lib/*.js`）是启动时 import 的；浏览器半（`lib/ui/client.js`）在页面刷新时重新加载。

